    {
      "sentences": [
        {
          "en": "In this game the child will practise making up questions.",
          "zh": "在……里这个游戏这孩子将练习做向上问题。",
          "startMs": 11897,
          "endMs": 15080
        },
        {
          "en": "It also helps the child to remember details.",
          "zh": "它也帮助这孩子到记得细节。",
          "startMs": 15080,
          "endMs": 17537
        },
        {
          "en": "• Look at any page in the book and make up a question about it, e.",
          "zh": "• 看在任何页在……里这书和做向上一个问题关于它， 呃。",
          "startMs": 17537,
          "endMs": 21222
        },
        {
          "en": "\"Who had a letter B on her jumper?\"",
          "zh": "谁有一个信第二在……上她跳？",
          "startMs": 21222,
          "endMs": 23176
        },
        {
          "en": "Check the answer in the book.",
          "zh": "查明这回答在……里这书。",
          "startMs": 23176,
          "endMs": 24796
        },
        {
          "en": "Then the child makes up a question for you.",
          "zh": "然后这孩子做向上一个问题为了你。",
          "startMs": 24796,
          "endMs": 27197
        },
        {
          "en": "Have two or three turns each.",
          "zh": "有二或者三转动每个。",
          "startMs": 27197,
          "endMs": 28816
        },
        {
          "en": "You can use these ideas straight away, or on another day.",
          "zh": "你能使用这些主意直的离开， 或者在……上另一个一天。",
          "startMs": 28816,
          "endMs": 31999
        },
        {
          "en": "• Find 'was' as often as you can in the book.",
          "zh": "• 找到 '是' 像经常像你能在……里这书。",
          "startMs": 31999,
          "endMs": 34512
        },
        {
          "en": "Notice that it is the first part of 'wasn't' on page 7.",
          "zh": "布告那个它是这第一部分的 '不是' 在……上页 7。",
          "startMs": 34512,
          "endMs": 37583
        },
        {
          "en": "Practise spelling 'was'.",
          "zh": "练习拼写 '是'。",
          "startMs": 37583,
          "endMs": 38923
        },
        {
          "en": "• Take turns to make up questions about people you know.",
          "zh": "• 拿转动到做向上问题关于人们你知道。",
